      "items": [
        "The Solar System is a gravitationally bound system centered around the Sun.",
        "The order of planets from closest to furthest from the Sun is Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, and Neptune.",
        "The mnemonic 'My Very Educated Mother Just Served Us Noodles' helps easily recall the sequence of the eight planets."
      ],
